One thing that's important to me is keeping tabs on various
subjects. For that, I want to have some up to date research material to
draw on, and then I would work on my own notes. I would want agents to
periodically update the research material.

Take software factories as an example. That's a topic that's moving
quickly, that has its own history, and on any given day someone could
release a project that makes waves.

I want to think about a strategy and way of organizing this sort of
thing. I'm especially interested to get ideas from other people who are
doing something similar with this.

I'm not concerned with keeping any of the approaches that I've attempted
in this repo. I want to take a step back, and get a higher level look at
how to go about this.

Essentially I want a research assistant for various subjects. I still
want to produce my own notes material - that's a big part of how I
learn. But gathering the information, organizing it, presenting it in a
way that's useful for me to digest - I think that's a place where agents
can come in really useful.
